WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.994
SPEAKER: Making friends here
is sometimes what saves
people's lives.

00:00:06.269 --> 00:00:08.881
Or what gets them up out of bed
in the morning.

00:00:08.981 --> 00:00:10.800
♪ (UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.650
I am a teacher
for Helping Hands,

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:18.433
a sign language community
here in VR chat.

00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:21.219
Hand rested under elbow
and we're gonna go like this.

00:00:21.319 --> 00:00:22.504
Christmas.

00:00:23.104 --> 00:00:25.215
Slow, quick, quick, slow.

00:00:25.315 --> 00:00:28.868
If I had confidence that I could
teach dance as a living in VR,

00:00:28.968 --> 00:00:30.537
I totally would do exactly that.

00:00:30.662 --> 00:00:32.997
SPEAKER 2: With a long distance
relationship,

00:00:33.097 --> 00:00:35.325
having VR is a game changer.

00:00:35.425 --> 00:00:38.169
SPEAKER 3:
We are 5,000 miles apart,

00:00:38.269 --> 00:00:40.788
but we're gonna try our best
to make it work.

00:00:42.788 --> 00:00:44.292
SPEAKER 4:
This year has been really hard.

00:00:44.392 --> 00:00:45.810
The thing that has kept me sane

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:48.838
has been VR
and the VR community.

00:00:50.363 --> 00:00:52.834
I would not have weathered this
without you guys.

00:00:52.934 --> 00:00:56.738
Three, two, one,
happy New Year!

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.648
(DINOSAUR ROARS)

00:00:58.767 --> 00:00:59.850
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.944
SPEAKER 5: You can be
who you've always wanted to be.

00:01:03.044 --> 00:01:05.463
And you can,
in a way, start over.

00:01:06.213 --> 00:01:08.724
We can come together
and support each other.

00:01:09.024 --> 00:01:10.543
This community
means a lot to me

00:01:10.627 --> 00:01:12.197
and I really want them to know
that they're loved.

00:01:14.026 --> 00:01:15.782
-SPEAKER 6: True.
-It's been a year since...

00:01:15.907 --> 00:01:18.659
-SPEAKER 6: That's true.
-...I've seen Kevin's IRL body.

00:01:18.909 --> 00:01:20.420
(LAUGHTER)

00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:22.505
-It sounds funny.
-"Kevin's IRL body."

